# Figures knitted from the repo root. precompile.R writes them here before
# moving them into vignettes/ and deleting them, so they are transient -- but an
# ad-hoc knit of a single chunk leaves them behind, and `git add -A` then commits
# six stray copies of files that already live in vignettes/. That happened in
# bb977541; .Rbuildignore has no rule for them, so they would have shipped in the
# tarball. The vignettes/ copies are the tracked ones.
/vignette-fig-*.png

